1. First candidate affected run: 93/99 passed. Five old-noon snapshot assertions correctly failed (three share-card, one OG, one Inspector-related assertion); they now assert the intended reference text while retaining numerical/privacy/known-time assertions. The sixth failure is the root-owned generated-manifest currency check, still intentionally unresolved in this author source patch.
